# Manifold level 9
# The citadel (stage 4.5f): the level that pushes the engine before the games, built with the kit
# (decision 0026) on three floors. A courtyard; a gatehouse whose door a button opens, with a stick and
# a crate; a gate of two leaves the crate holds open from a plate; a great hall two floors high with a
# guard, stairs up to a gallery, and a double door a button opens; a ferry across a well a floor up; a
# library where a lamp lights a plate an eye watches (break the lamp, and the door opens); a lift to the
# roofs; across the well by its bridges, a guard on the hall's roof, a ramp up to a deck, and a bridge
# to the tower's top: the goal. Every wall, floor, stair, ramp, bridge and railing is a piece of the kit;
# what moves (the doors, the gate, the ferry, the lift) is a box the simulation moves, drawn with the
# kit's leaves where it is a door.
title The citadel
spawn -2 1 9
facing 0 0 -1
ambient 0.3

# THE COURTYARD (x −8 to 8, z 0 to 12), under the sky, walled 6 m high (two rows of walls); the gatehouse
# in its corner, the hall's gate at its north side, and the plate that holds the gate open.
kit floor_4  -6 0 2
kit floor_4  -2 0 2
kit floor_4  2 0 2
kit floor_4  6 0 2
kit floor_4  -6 0 6
kit floor_4  -2 0 6
kit floor_4  2 0 6
kit floor_4  6 0 6
kit floor_4  -6 0 10
kit floor_4  -2 0 10
kit floor_4  2 0 10
kit floor_4  6 0 10
kit wall_4  -6 0 12
kit wall_4  -2 0 12
kit wall_4  2 0 12
kit wall_4  6 0 12
kit wall_4  -6 3 12
kit wall_4  -2 3 12
kit wall_4  2 3 12
kit wall_4  6 3 12
kit wall_4  -8 0 2  rotate y 90
kit wall_4  -8 0 6  rotate y 90
kit wall_4  -8 0 10  rotate y 90
kit wall_4  -8 3 2  rotate y 90
kit wall_4  -8 3 6  rotate y 90
kit wall_4  -8 3 10  rotate y 90
kit pillar  -8 0 12
kit pillar  -8 3 12
box -4 1.41 8  0.06 1.41 0.06  color #4a4440
lamp -4 3 8  7 1  model dojo.lamp
box 4 1.41 8  0.06 1.41 0.06  color #4a4440
lamp 4 3 8  7 1  model dojo.lamp

# THE GATEHOUSE (x −8 to −4, z 0 to 4), a floor high and roofed: its door, of a meter, hinged at its
# north edge, turns into it while `small_door` is on; the button on its wall flips it. Inside, two racks
# (walk into one to take what is on it): a dart, which a guard cannot block, and a stick, which it can;
# and a crate of wood (G grabs it, and lets it go).
kit wall_2  -4 0 1  rotate y 90
kit wall_door  -4 0 3  rotate y 90
kit wall_4  -6 0 4
kit pillar  -4 0 4
kit roof_4  -6 3 2
box -4 1.1 3     0.5 1.1 0.03  rotate y 90  door 0 0 0.5 y 90 1 small_door  color #8a6a42  model kit.door_1  name small_door
box -3.82 1.2 1.4  0.03 0.12 0.12  color #c04040
sensor button    -3.3 0.9 1.4  0.5 0.9 0.5  name small_button
signal small_pressed  used small_button
signal small_door     toggle small_pressed
sensor weapon    -7 0.5 1     0.4 0.5 0.4  kind 1  name dart_rack
sensor weapon    -5.4 0.5 1   0.4 0.5 0.4  kind 3  name stick_rack
box -6 0.2 3     0.2 0.2 0.2   dynamic  material wood  color #9a7a4a  name crate

box -6 2.8 2  0.015 0.2 0.015  color #3a3632
lamp -6 2.4 2  4 0.8  model dojo.lamp

# THE GATE, in the hall's south wall (z = 0): two leaves of 1.2 m by 2.6, hinged at the gate's sides,
# turning into the hall while something is on the plate, 10 m away in the courtyard: running from the
# plate, the gate is shut before you are there; the crate left on it holds it open.
kit wall_4  -6 0 0
kit wall_4  -2 0 0
kit wall_gate  2 0 0
kit wall_4  6 0 0
kit wall_4  -6 3 0
kit wall_4  -2 3 0
kit wall_4  2 3 0
kit wall_4  6 3 0
box 1.4 1.3 0    0.6 1.3 0.05  door -0.6 0 0 y 90 1 gate_open  color #8a6a42  model kit.gate_leaf  name gate_west
box 2.6 1.3 0    0.6 1.3 0.05  rotate y 180  door 0.6 0 0 y -90 1 gate_open  color #8a6a42  model kit.gate_leaf  name gate_east
box 6 0.025 9    0.6 0.025 0.6  color #a04040
sensor plate     6 0.7 9      0.6 0.7 0.6  name gate_plate
signal gate_open  zone gate_plate

