# The library (z 0 to 8): a lamp on a post lights the plate before its door, and an eye by the door
# looks down the room (−Z): the door opens, and stays open, for someone on the plate the eye does not
# see. Shelves along its east wall.
box 11.6 3.66 5.4  0.06 0.66 0.06  color #4a4440
lamp 11.6 4.5 5.4  5 1  breaks 0.3  model dojo.lamp  name lamp
