# The lift's room (z 8 to 12): the lift, a floor up to the roof through the hole it fills there. Standing
# on it sends it up; the plate by it on the roof calls it up; the plate beside it here calls it down.
box 10.075 3.15 10  1.925 0.15 1.85  lift 0 2.7 0 3 lift_up  color #7a5a3a  name lift
box 14 3.025 10.5  0.6 0.025 0.6  color #a04040
box 14 6.025 10    0.6 0.025 0.6  color #a04040
sensor plate  10.075 3.8 10   1.8 0.5 1.75  name on_lift
sensor plate  14 3.7 10.5     0.6 0.7 0.6   name call_down
sensor plate  14 6.7 10       0.6 0.7 0.6   name call_up
signal riding   zone on_lift
signal called   zone call_up
signal sent     zone call_down
signal up       any riding called
signal lift_up  latch up sent
box 14 5.6 10  0.015 0.2 0.015  color #3a3632
lamp 14 5.2 10  4 0.8  model dojo.lamp

